{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國AI企業DeepSeek、月之暗面（Moonshot AI）、MiniMax和螞蟻集團的最新模型，可能已經使用英偉達最新一代Blackwell GPU進行初始化，甚至可能利用這些晶片完成大規模訓練。一個名為Unemployment Labs的獨立研究團隊通過分析公開發布的AI模型權重，發現其中保留了與特定英偉達GPU架構相匹配的數字特徵。這項研究為此前有關中國AI企業獲得受美國出口管制限制的Blackwell晶片的猜測，提供了新的技術證據。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586310.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:45:31.611418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:22:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.984486+00:00","content_hash":"c7e320b05e2bc37d8dfc45eda568918855f47ad6e8c477c409be96d47a08b27c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}